                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "940fb380-6bab-3224-9f5b-662033835e3a",
                        "entry_id": "a8bef1a6-e368-38f7-a02e-7c4acf919454",
                        "glosses": [
                            "наречие к предположительный; основываясь на предположении, предположениях"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "adverb"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8455cbaf-5cb6-4d4f-8cdc-d5985477fa8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "a8bef1a6-e368-38f7-a02e-7c4acf919454",
                        "source_sense_id": "940fb380-6bab-3224-9f5b-662033835e3a",
                        "target_lang_word": "supposedly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "supposedly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                        "entry_id": "54844651-2a61-3690-9baa-44d6456654c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As a matter of supposition; in the beliefs or according to the claims of some people."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d7f1b8a-d91b-4c41-b17a-f2510860ecb2",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: supposably, reportedly, reputedly, purportedly, putatively, rumoredly, allegedly, ostensibly, possibly, probably, likely, plausibly"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4c5fdfd-50ff-467f-bf65-728d49239dc7",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "People from other planets have supposedly visited Earth in flying saucers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dde08667-4423-4e08-9eed-b8fa57c6f6df",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "According to your testimony, you were supposedly at home watching TV when the murder occurred."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "680d4966-78b8-499b-84ea-13e8125111d3",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "In these early days of silent pictures, the accent was chiefly on thrills and danger as provided by supposedly unstoppable locomotives with crooks or maniacs on the footplate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a37ff2e2-3dd4-470a-85cf-71c54aa570d1",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "France were supposedly a team in pieces, beaten by Tonga just a week ago and with coach Marc Lievremont publicly berating his players, but so clear-cut was their victory that much of the atmosphere had been sucked from the contest long before the end."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b36f221-78da-42a2-a6cf-a842e768a42d",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "I haven't booked, so I don't have a clue as to whether the service will be busy or not. Supposedly, reservations are compulsory, but I want to find out what would happen if you just turn up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2634290-d698-41fb-bb76-1c1f6dbea3d5",
                                                "sense_id": "527c1d97-4f7b-3d43-abb7-f6ed315055d6",
                                                "text": "Beyond the glaring sexism inherent in suggesting that women's brains are so different from men's that they can't think properly, Musk lending credence to this dogshit hypothesis is incredibly goofy given that he and his audience of supposedly \"high-T\" men seem far more likely to fall in line with the sort of groupthink the original post references in such pseudo-phrenological terms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "092900df-2b26-306a-89ab-48377e0aea89",
                                        "entry_id": "54844651-2a61-3690-9baa-44d6456654c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used in place of \\\"supposed to be,\\\" often in informal or colloquial speech, as a mispronunciation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "informal",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6dd9e09-3746-469c-903c-db4ced925da9",
                                                "sense_id": "092900df-2b26-306a-89ab-48377e0aea89",
                                                "text": "My parents told me I am supposedly in bed by 10 P.M."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28c2ff43-c753-4d38-a97d-bf91c0004345",
                        "source_entry_id": "a8bef1a6-e368-38f7-a02e-7c4acf919454",
                        "source_sense_id": "940fb380-6bab-3224-9f5b-662033835e3a",
                        "target_lang_word": "admittedly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "admittedly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "381a2e57-a45f-3b86-9ba1-0199a1c59ebc",
                                        "entry_id": "64417f4c-eb76-34f5-ad5f-3d12d7e525af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "As is acknowledged to be true; by general admission; confessedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "686988c4-a84d-4fe1-a412-277249a34ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "381a2e57-a45f-3b86-9ba1-0199a1c59ebc",
                                                "text": "Admittedly, vandalism is a bit of a problem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff7a7a85-aab5-47ff-8e21-36fde53bb1fe",
                                                "sense_id": "381a2e57-a45f-3b86-9ba1-0199a1c59ebc",
                                                "text": "She was admittedly the one who killed the baron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d320e75-99d5-498a-a029-033a72d85509",
                                                "sense_id": "381a2e57-a45f-3b86-9ba1-0199a1c59ebc",
                                                "text": "Adopting a computerlike countermeasure for a problem enabled by computer algorithms is admittedly an unnatural practice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c502d82d-4f7d-3a56-94dc-cfdc4765ce52",
                                        "entry_id": "64417f4c-eb76-34f5-ad5f-3d12d7e525af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Signals a concession followed by a counterpoint usually headed by but."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "conjunctive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fbd8497-ea55-4b7d-abe7-a401571e0a64",
                                                "sense_id": "c502d82d-4f7d-3a56-94dc-cfdc4765ce52",
                                                "text": "It's only a theory, admittedly, but it might work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "866caba6-fa0e-4d25-8121-d177e8f14277",
                                                "sense_id": "c502d82d-4f7d-3a56-94dc-cfdc4765ce52",
                                                "text": "Admittedly he can't swim, but he still loves going to the seaside anyway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a219e06e-4ef7-44f5-9eef-2318de5ba134",
                        "source_entry_id": "a8bef1a6-e368-38f7-a02e-7c4acf919454",
